<para id="RM0000005L700QX" category="C" type-id="300BJ" name-id="5229B-00" from="200612">
<dtccode>B1441/41</dtccode>
<dtcname>(P-seat) Air mix damper operation malfunction</dtcname>
<subpara id="RM0000005L700QX_09" type-id="31" category="03" proc-id="RM0550J___0000BYJ00000">
<name>Circuit Description</name>
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<ptxt>The air mix damper servo sends the damper position to the air conditioner amplifier assembly by pulse signals. Based on this signal, the air conditioner amplifier assembly rotates the motor (forward, reverse) and moves the air mix damper to the desired position. This adjusts the proportion of air passing through the heater core after passing through the evaporator, and controls the outlet temperature on the front passenger side.</ptxt>
<table pgwide="1">
<tgroup cols="3" align="left">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="1.00in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="3.00in"/>
<colspec colname="COL3" colwidth="3.09in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>DTC No.</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Diagnosis Description</ptxt>
<list1 type="ordered">
<item>
<ptxt>Diagnosis Condition</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Abnormal Condition</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Malfunction Duration</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Inspection Area</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>B1441/41</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<list1 type="ordered">
<item>
<ptxt>When air mix damper servo (P-seat) is operating</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Damper servo drive request signal is output, but servo position information does not change or is abnormal</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>30 seconds or more</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>Air mix damper servo (P-seat)</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
